# p_9c3d — Priya does afternoon yoga at 15:00, not morning (fork of p_c9d4)

This fork corrects the single most important error in p_c9d4: the yoga session is NOT at 06:00. The evidence shows yoga_mat_priya at floor_l_l1 on weekday 15:00 (two sightings) and on weekend 20:00 (one sighting). The parent's 06:00–06:45 window has produced zero supporting sightings, while the "mat back in wardrobe by 07:00" claim has been against three times. Priya's actual routine: she does yoga in the mid-afternoon on weekdays (around 14:00–17:00, after her morning walk and before dinner prep) and in the early evening on weekends (19:00–21:00, after her late-morning walk and afternoon rest).

The guitar correction from the parent is also applied: on weekend evenings the guitar is on the couch (two sightings at 21:00), not in the bedroom. The camera remains on the bookshelf (7/7 sighted days, one receptacle).

What changed from the parent: (1) yoga_mat_priya blocks moved from 06:00–06:45 to weekday 14–17 h and weekend 19–21 h at floor_l_l1; (2) the 06:00 claim is removed and replaced with a 15:00 weekday claim; (3) guitar_hana gains a weekend 19–23 h block at couch_l1.

What would refute this fork: yoga_mat_priya sighted at floor_l_l1 at 06:00 (the old time); yoga_mat_priya at wardrobe_b2 during weekday 14–17 h; guitar_hana at bedroom_floor_b1 during weekend 19–23 h.

